# Caddy reverse proxy for HTTP/2 + TLS
# Eliminates Chrome's 6-connection limit on HTTP/1.1
# which blocks SSE-heavy pages (Datastar) when multiple tabs are open.
#
# Note: We do NOT add `encode` directive here because:
# 1. SSE streams handle their own Brotli compression (Content-Encoding: br)
# 2. Static files can be pre-compressed if needed
# Caddy passes through our Content-Encoding headers correctly.
#
# Access via: https://localhost:3030
# First visit: accept the self-signed certificate warning in your browser.

https://localhost:3030 {
	reverse_proxy localhost:8080
}
